{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_18105300","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18105300","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1810529001:":{"text":"만월이다!","source_cn":"满月了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x19603FBF8351D9CB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"만월이다!","female":"만월이다!","variant_male_record_index":"243563","variant_female_record_index":"243564","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1810529002:":{"text":"계속 가!","source_cn":"继续向前！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF56535BB5DDA2CF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1810529003:":{"text":"아니요. 늦었습니다!","source_cn":"不，来不及了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31CE9D57CF2DB9FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1810529005:":{"text":"세인!","source_cn":"瑟恩——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x586998BAE6FBC283","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1810529004:":{"text":"여기는 저에게 맡기고 먼저 가십시오.","source_cn":"你们先走，这里交给我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22DA5D5E44EECC09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1810529006:":{"text":"조심해요!","source_cn":"小心！<key:dialog88>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF2EBD9AE98AED27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1810529007:":{"text":"크오오오...!","source_cn":"嗬啊啊啊……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CE16E827A3EBFCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810530001:0":{"text":"세인, 괜찮아?","source_cn":"瑟恩，你没事吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x140905E08853DA5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810530002:0":{"text":"다치지 않았으니 걱정 마십시오.","source_cn":"没有受伤，不用担心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0FFEB4E84A2917A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1810530003:0":{"text":"하지만 바든... 너무 무모하잖아. 무기도 없이 공격하다니, 뒷일을 생각하기는 한 건가?","source_cn":"倒是巴登……你太鲁莽了，不拿武器就发起攻击，你想过后面...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76DFD44699969660","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810530004:0":{"text":"방심한 건 당신 아닌가요? 분명 경험이 많은 것처럼 보이는데, 대체 왜 이렇게 쉽게 제압당한 거예요?","source_cn":"你才是轻敌的那个人吧？明明看起来身经百战，为什么才一招...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91F05F3AD131E6B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1810530005:1":{"text":"...그동안 다른 일로 바빠서 훈련을 게을리한 탓이겠지.","source_cn":"……或许是我这几年一直忙于其他事务，疏于锻炼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E662BFC6E4121D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1810530006:1":{"text":"한 팔로 대응하기 어려운 일이 있다는 걸 인정할 수밖에 없겠군.","source_cn":"我也得承认，有些局面，独臂确实应对不来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45648D91914B0C25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1810530007:1":{"text":"하... 딱히 탓하려던 건 아니고요.","source_cn":"哎……我不是想责怪你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AF1327B46598B71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1810530008:1":{"text":"그냥...\n아, 진짜 뭐라고 설명해야 할지 모르겠네요...","source_cn":"我只是想说——\\n哎呀，我也不知道该怎么解释了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6415D852DA661DD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1810530009:1":{"text":"네 뜻은 알겠으니 설명은 필요 없다.","source_cn":"不必解释，我明白你的意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA321B4E228369ED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1810530010:0":{"text":"네가 타인을 지키기 위해 나설 수 있다는 것만으로도, 내가 알던 바든이라는 걸 증명하기에 충분하니까.","source_cn":"你能为保护他人挺身而出，足以证明，你还是我认识的那个巴登。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D4CCFDD4FE7FFAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1810530011:0":{"text":"그런 말, 별로 좋아하지는 않지만... 당신 말이 조금은 사실일지도 몰라요.","source_cn":"我不喜欢听到这些话，但……也许你说的有那么一点可能是真的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCF83BB7A566546D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1810530012:0":{"text":"진짜? 그럼 우리 말을 믿어주는 거야?","source_cn":"真的？你愿意相信我和瑟恩说的话了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8476F56D189DFFB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1810530013:1":{"text":"아주 조금은요. 무의식적인 반응은 거짓말을 못 하잖아요.","source_cn":"只是有一点相信，毕竟下意识的反应没办法骗人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF693032A6590070E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1810530014:1":{"text":"저와 당신, 그리고 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님의 친분이라면 대충 납득이 가지만, 세인 님은...","source_cn":"以我和你、和<style=stress><player...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA43486DE9FA7D184","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"저와 당신, 그리고 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님의 친분이라면 대충 납득이 가지만, 세인 님은...","female":"저와 당신, 그리고 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님의 친분이라면 대충 납득이 가지만, 세인 님은...","variant_male_record_index":"243581","variant_female_record_index":"243582","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1810530014":{"text":"저와 당신, 그리고 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님의 친분이라면 대충 납득이 가지만, 세인 님은...","source_cn":"以我和你、和<style=stress><player_name></style>的交情还说得过去，但瑟恩嘛……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA43486DE9FA7D184","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"저와 당신, 그리고 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님의 친분이라면 대충 납득이 가지만, 세인 님은...","female":"저와 당신, 그리고 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님의 친분이라면 대충 납득이 가지만, 세인 님은...","variant_male_record_index":"243581","variant_female_record_index":"243582","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1810530015:1":{"text":"그래요? 착각이겠죠.","source_cn":"是吗？是你的错觉吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x49A18DB3764D7B51","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그래요? 착각이겠죠.","female":"그래요? 착각이겠죠.","variant_male_record_index":"243583","variant_female_record_index":"243584","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1810530016:0":{"text":"네가 기억을 되찾는다면, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>의 판단이 아주 정확하다는 걸 알게 될 거야.","source_cn":"如果你能尽早恢复记忆，你就会发现<style=stre...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5AB4066C8C3AD4C9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네가 기억을 되찾는다면, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>의 판단이 아주 정확하다는 걸 알게 될 거야.","female":"네가 기억을 되찾는다면, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>의 판단이 아주 정확하다는 걸 알게 될 거야.","variant_male_record_index":"243585","variant_female_recor